//! TC-OPT-012: NeRF Synthetic Benchmark
//!
//! This test verifies that the implementation achieves expected quality on the
//! standard NeRF Synthetic 'lego' scene after 30,000 training iterations.
//!
//! Reference Metrics (from 3DGS paper):
//! - PSNR: ~35.0 dB
